{
  "cues": [
    {
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "We found their tools."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 1.68,
      "end_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Where are their clothes?"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 3.52,
      "end_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Picture a riverbank."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 5.12,
      "end_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "More than a million years ago,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 6.88,
      "end_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "someone picks up a stone\nand chips away at it"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 9.32,
      "end_seconds": 11.36,
      "text": "until one edge becomes sharp."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 11.56,
      "end_seconds": 14.0,
      "text": "Water, wind and time will wear away"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 14.24,
      "end_seconds": 15.92,
      "text": "almost everything around it."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 16.0,
      "end_seconds": 18.4,
      "text": "But that stone will survive."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 18.48,
      "end_seconds": 20.48,
      "text": "Thousands of generations pass."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 20.56,
      "end_seconds": 22.0,
      "text": "New people come to the river,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 22.16,
      "end_seconds": 23.68,
      "text": "bringing new tools with them:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 23.76,
      "end_seconds": 26.96,
      "text": "bone needles, shaped\nby careful human hands."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 27.04,
      "end_seconds": 30.08,
      "text": "Stone and bone outlast\nthe people who made them."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 30.32,
      "end_seconds": 32.4,
      "text": "Almost all their clothing is gone."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 32.48,
      "end_seconds": 34.4,
      "text": "But not quite everything."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 34.48,
      "end_seconds": 35.84,
      "text": "Here\u2019s a tiny sandal,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 35.88,
      "end_seconds": 37.68,
      "text": "woven from esparto grass."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 37.72,
      "end_seconds": 39.84,
      "text": "A living person once wore it."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 40.04,
      "end_seconds": 41.92,
      "text": "Imagine them pulling the straps tight,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 42.0,
      "end_seconds": 43.04,
      "text": "stepping outside,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 43.12,
      "end_seconds": 45.76,
      "text": "and heading off to whatever\nthe day had in store."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 45.84,
      "end_seconds": 47.2,
      "text": "Thousands of years later,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 47.28,
      "end_seconds": 49.12,
      "text": "the sandal is still here."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 49.44,
      "end_seconds": 51.88,
      "text": "Suddenly, the past has more than tools."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 52.08,
      "end_seconds": 53.12,
      "text": "It has feet."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 53.44,
      "end_seconds": 54.96,
      "text": "Follow its owner's footsteps,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 55.0,
      "end_seconds": 57.6,
      "text": "and we reach the other\nbank: Roman Britain."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 58.08,
      "end_seconds": 61.08,
      "text": "Tunics, cloaks, belts, shoes."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 61.36,
      "end_seconds": 63.52,
      "text": "Now we're not looking at isolated traces."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 63.68,
      "end_seconds": 65.04,
      "text": "We're looking at people,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 65.08,
      "end_seconds": 67.6,
      "text": "dressed and ready to go about their lives."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 67.68,
      "end_seconds": 69.44,
      "text": "One look gives way to another,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 69.52,
      "end_seconds": 71.44,
      "text": "and the river carries us on."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 71.52,
      "end_seconds": 72.96,
      "text": "By around 1400,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 73.04,
      "end_seconds": 74.96,
      "text": "the silhouettes have changed again."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 75.04,
      "end_seconds": 78.0,
      "text": "Long garments, belts, head coverings."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 78.08,
      "end_seconds": 81.0,
      "text": "Straight lines give way\nto folds and layers."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 81.04,
      "end_seconds": 82.12,
      "text": "Even from a distance,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 82.16,
      "end_seconds": 84.88,
      "text": "you can see how different\na passerby looks."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 84.96,
      "end_seconds": 88.04,
      "text": "Now it's Amsterdam, 1559."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 88.08,
      "end_seconds": 89.56,
      "text": "A family portrait."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 89.6,
      "end_seconds": 90.72,
      "text": "Look closely:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 90.84,
      "end_seconds": 93.04,
      "text": "these people belong to the same family,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 93.12,
      "end_seconds": 95.16,
      "text": "but each has a style of their own."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 95.2,
      "end_seconds": 98.28,
      "text": "Different hats, fabrics, little details."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 98.32,
      "end_seconds": 99.147,
      "text": "One painting,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 99.173,
      "end_seconds": 100.8,
      "text": "and a whole family of strangers"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 101.0,
      "end_seconds": 103.4,
      "text": "looking straight at us\nacross the centuries."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 103.44,
      "end_seconds": 104.92,
      "text": "Which would you choose?"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 104.96,
      "end_seconds": 107.72,
      "text": "The river carries us into\nthe eighteenth century."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 107.76,
      "end_seconds": 109.88,
      "text": "A French dress spreads wide."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 109.92,
      "end_seconds": 112.16,
      "text": "Beside it, a British court outfit:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 112.24,
      "end_seconds": 115.653,
      "text": "fine decoration, a waistcoat, a long coat."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 115.707,
      "end_seconds": 117.6,
      "text": "You wouldn't exactly\nblend into the background"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 117.68,
      "end_seconds": 119.16,
      "text": "wearing either of these."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 119.2,
      "end_seconds": 120.293,
      "text": "Walk into a room,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 120.347,
      "end_seconds": 122.68,
      "text": "and your outfit arrives before you do."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 122.72,
      "end_seconds": 124.92,
      "text": "But wide is not the limit."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 124.96,
      "end_seconds": 126.213,
      "text": "In the nineteenth century,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 126.267,
      "end_seconds": 128.56,
      "text": "the crinoline appears beneath the skirt."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 128.64,
      "end_seconds": 130.24,
      "text": "Suddenly, a person is surrounded"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 130.32,
      "end_seconds": 132.48,
      "text": "by a whole dome of fabric."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 132.56,
      "end_seconds": 134.373,
      "text": "Imagine trying to get through a doorway,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 134.427,
      "end_seconds": 136.6,
      "text": "or sitting next to someone in a carriage."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 136.64,
      "end_seconds": 138.293,
      "text": "Now let's jump ahead."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 138.347,
      "end_seconds": 139.893,
      "text": "The 1920s."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 139.947,
      "end_seconds": 140.933,
      "text": "In some dresses,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 140.987,
      "end_seconds": 142.56,
      "text": "that enormous dome gives way"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 142.64,
      "end_seconds": 144.64,
      "text": "to a completely different shape:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 144.72,
      "end_seconds": 147.0,
      "text": "long, straight and loose."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 147.04,
      "end_seconds": 148.64,
      "text": "Like a broad wave on the river"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 148.72,
      "end_seconds": 150.36,
      "text": "suddenly smoothing out."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 150.4,
      "end_seconds": 151.333,
      "text": "One more step,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 151.387,
      "end_seconds": 153.2,
      "text": "and we're on a modern street."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 153.28,
      "end_seconds": 154.52,
      "text": "Jeans and dresses,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 154.56,
      "end_seconds": 156.36,
      "text": "sneakers and tailored suits,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 156.4,
      "end_seconds": 157.68,
      "text": "all side by side."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 157.76,
      "end_seconds": 159.84,
      "text": "We wear these things every day,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 159.92,
      "end_seconds": 161.36,
      "text": "hardly thinking that one day"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 161.52,
      "end_seconds": 162.88,
      "text": "they'll be history too."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 163.2,
      "end_seconds": 165.08,
      "text": "Picture a museum in the future."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 165.36,
      "end_seconds": 166.56,
      "text": "Behind the glass:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 166.64,
      "end_seconds": 170.04,
      "text": "our sneakers, a jacket,\nsomeone's favorite T-shirt."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 170.32,
      "end_seconds": 172.08,
      "text": "Visitors study them as closely"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 172.16,
      "end_seconds": 174.0,
      "text": "as we study that ancient sandal."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 174.48,
      "end_seconds": 177.36,
      "text": "Maybe they wonder who wore\nthem, and where they were going."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 177.92,
      "end_seconds": 179.44,
      "text": "The river keeps flowing."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 179.84,
      "end_seconds": 181.84,
      "text": "Things survive, disappear,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 181.88,
      "end_seconds": 184.12,
      "text": "and surprise people centuries later."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 184.4,
      "end_seconds": 185.76,
      "text": "We found their tools."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 186.0,
      "end_seconds": 187.6,
      "text": "What will they find after us?"
    }
  ]
}